{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has gone wrong, you wake up abandoned and alone in a radioactive and derelict world filled with anomalies and unspeakable horrors. Your memories are gone, you are low on resources and every wasted minute brings you closer to your death. Your only hope for survival is to make it to the end of the road to try and find another group of survivors that set out before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you soon realize that not everything is as it first seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/fc437a33189166ca9c75caa0099cc0d0.poster.avif?t=1738340310\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/fc437a33189166ca9c75caa0099cc0d0.webm?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/fc437a33189166ca9c75caa0099cc0d0.mp4?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat mode update</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth and tools to avoid and escape threats or try the optional combat mode update which allows you to fight back against the horrors you\u2019ll face on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/504b61215d02c17019f45dce6fd35607.poster.avif?t=1738340310\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/504b61215d02c17019f45dce6fd35607.webm?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/504b61215d02c17019f45dce6fd35607.mp4?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in a dynamic world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing weather, day and night cycle and other more unpredictable and sinister events makes for a living and breathing world where every step could be your last. Roaming creatures make no area safe for a long period of time, which means you must always keep your wits about you if you are to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/f7674251f00b748d1942877ef71392db.poster.avif?t=1738340310\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/f7674251f00b748d1942877ef71392db.webm?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/f7674251f00b748d1942877ef71392db.mp4?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scavenge for resources </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned structures both above and below ground hold great dangers and rewards if you dare explore them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft items and upgrades for your equipment and your car to increase your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore deadly open world environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road and the surrounding woods hold many secrets for you to uncover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel by foot or by car through multiple treacherous areas which gives a unique experience with each playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover mysteries and solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth about what happened to the world around you and its inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face puzzles which can have different solutions in every playthrough.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/c006924a87c4e319af6315e188e1c3ef9344f659.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/97033109bfe4a76024500bdfa76943b142428d76.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter Three","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/55032cb4094702e24003121f3d9476c96d588a50.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter Four","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/ddc1175c2a01718ecb55658b2252b462787a554e.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter Five","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/f07b7e6fe0654b5358219fd50187fde9d391b321.jpg"},{"name":"Restoration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/5be2c8f5588b1a9f7104dcc48ccf2d787557910d.jpg"},{"name":"Destruction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/cc3ea48cbec3978da12464019dfab98d7dd9b831.jpg"},{"name":"Tinkerer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/b98411726c588f95202050678d610ac5b4d53c61.jpg"},{"name":"Obedience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/fc784d6145393fb5ad2f42409cbed874a02aa661.jpg"},{"name":"Defiance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1648990/9996d384a8e215015b4d7a0348191a728199ab7b.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1648990?t=1738340310","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738340310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/9e1db423d9eac696cb7f32c9a48eda229455e2d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738340310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/9e1db423d9eac696cb7f32c9a48eda229455e2d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738340310","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frightening visuals and sound, some gore and violence. Content which may not be appropriate for all ages."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has gone wrong, you wake up abandoned and alone in a radioactive and derelict world filled with anomalies and unspeakable horrors. Your memories are gone, you are low on resources and every wasted minute brings you closer to your death. Your only hope for survival is to make it to the end of the road to try and find another group of survivors that set out before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you soon realize that not everything is as it first seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/fc437a33189166ca9c75caa0099cc0d0.poster.avif?t=1738340310\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/fc437a33189166ca9c75caa0099cc0d0.webm?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/fc437a33189166ca9c75caa0099cc0d0.mp4?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat mode update</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth and tools to avoid and escape threats or try the optional combat mode update which allows you to fight back against the horrors you\u2019ll face on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/504b61215d02c17019f45dce6fd35607.poster.avif?t=1738340310\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/504b61215d02c17019f45dce6fd35607.webm?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/504b61215d02c17019f45dce6fd35607.mp4?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in a dynamic world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing weather, day and night cycle and other more unpredictable and sinister events makes for a living and breathing world where every step could be your last. Roaming creatures make no area safe for a long period of time, which means you must always keep your wits about you if you are to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/f7674251f00b748d1942877ef71392db.poster.avif?t=1738340310\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/f7674251f00b748d1942877ef71392db.webm?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/extras/f7674251f00b748d1942877ef71392db.mp4?t=1738340310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scavenge for resources </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned structures both above and below ground hold great dangers and rewards if you dare explore them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft items and upgrades for your equipment and your car to increase your chances of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore deadly open world environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The road and the surrounding woods hold many secrets for you to uncover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel by foot or by car through multiple treacherous areas which gives a unique experience with each playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover mysteries and solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth about what happened to the world around you and its inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face puzzles which can have different solutions in every playthrough.</p>","developers":["InputAlfa"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648990/header.jpg?t=1738340310","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1648990/821161/911a4fbcf7fb09fb0f0e4dffb3f4ce083ef272ca/1751013959/dash_av1.mpd?t=1738332771","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1648990/821161/911a4fbcf7fb09fb0f0e4dffb3f4ce083ef272ca/1751013959/dash_h264.mpd?t=1738332771","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1648990/821161/911a4fbcf7fb09fb0f0e4dffb3f4ce083ef272ca/1751013959/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1738332771","id":257093722,"name":"Combat Mode Update Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093722/10979fd6027efe409f23295ad7efb39833ed3f25/mo